## Commands

Run from the repository root:

| Command | Description |
| --- | --- |
| `moon run {{ name }}:dev -- --version` | Run locally with arguments |
| `make run APP={{ name }} TASK=test` | Run tests |
| `make run APP={{ name }} TASK=publish` | Publish to `dist/` |

## Structure

- `src/{{ name | pascal_case }}/App.cs` - tool logic (unit tested)
- `src/{{ name | pascal_case }}/Program.cs` - thin entry point
- `tests/{{ name | pascal_case }}.Tests/` - xUnit tests

